<form method="post" action="CryptoCustody.php" class="card p-3 mb-3"><h2 class="h5">Read-only Bybit account identity comparison</h2><p>Uses the selected vendor's server-configured personal, IP-bound read-only key. One authenticated query compares the provider-reported UID with this registry fingerprint and records the reported master/subaccount relationship. This does not verify legal custody eligibility, customer attribution or write permissions. Results are point-in-time evidence only, with a 15-minute freshness label; no approval or registry revision changes automatically. No provider calls occur on page load.</p><?php $target();?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="verify_provider"><label>Source vendor credential configuration ID<input class="form-control" name="source_vendor_id" inputmode="numeric" required></label><?php $security();?><button class="btn btn-outline-primary mt-2">Verify UID and store encrypted comparison evidence</button></form>
