<section class="card p-3 mb-3"><h2 class="h5">Single-attempt worker grants</h2><p>Server-configured service identity only. One stream revision, one claim, at most five minutes. Worker execution is disabled unless explicitly enabled on the server. No scheduler/window creation/settlement is granted. Revocation fences a later checkpoint, but cannot undo an already committed page or cancel a network request already sent. Use the protected report for grant IDs and state. Credentials are never entered or displayed here.</p>
