<section class="card p-3 mb-3"><h2 class="h5">Durable polling streams — manual one-page actions</h2><p>Create a bounded evidence-collection stream, fetch exactly one page, or stop it. Every action requires fresh step-up. Failed or unknown attempts impose 60/120-second retry delays; three consecutive unsuccessful attempts require investigation and block further operator reads on this stream. Stop remains available; no reset is provided. No background worker, automatic retries, imports or credits are enabled. Cursors come only from encrypted server state. A ready/exhausted label is not proof of complete history, customer allocation or settlement. A 60-second lease prevents concurrent operator reads; expired/stale attempts cannot commit.</p>
